<div class="content-wrapper"><section class="content-header"><h1>Basic Tarif Pass Pelabuhan</h1></section><section class="content"><?php if($error): ?><div class="alert alert-danger"><?= html_escape($error) ?></div><?php endif; ?><div class="box box-primary"><div class="box-body"><p>Tarif IDR per kunjungan. Riwayat bertanggal; pass yang sudah dibuat mempertahankan tarifnya. Isi tarif sesuai keputusan resmi area Anda.</p><p><button type="button" class="btn btn-default btn-sm" data-pass-preset="medium">Isi contoh Truck Sedang (lampiran Lembar)</button> <button type="button" class="btn btn-default btn-sm" data-pass-preset="large">Isi contoh Truck Besar (lampiran Lembar)</button></p><small>Contoh hanya mengisi angka tarif dan keputusan; pilih area serta tanggal berlaku sebelum menyimpan.</small><form method="post" id="pass-tariff-form"><?php $this->load->view('pipeline/billing_token'); ?><div class="row"><div class="col-sm-6 form-group"><label>Area</label><select name="SpbbID" class="form-control" required><?php foreach($branches as $b): ?><option value="<?= (int)$b['SpbbID'] ?>"><?= html_escape($b['SpbbName']) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></div><?php foreach(array('VehicleType'=>'Jenis Kendaraan (mis. Truck Sedang / Gol. V)','EffectiveDate'=>'Berlaku Mulai','PersonRate'=>'Tarif Pas Orang / Orang (Rp)','VehicleRate'=>'Tarif Pas Kendaraan / Unit (Rp)','BerthRate'=>'Tarif Jasa Dermaga / Unit (Rp)','DecisionNo'=>'Nomor dan Tanggal Keputusan Tarif') as $key=>$label): ?><div class="col-sm-6 form-group"><label><?= $label ?></label><input name="<?= $key ?>" class="form-control" type="<?= $key==='EffectiveDate'?'date':(strpos($key,'Rate')!==false?'number':'text') ?>" maxlength="<?= $key==='VehicleType'?100:200 ?>" <?= strpos($key,'Rate')!==false?'min="0" step="0.0001"':'' ?> required></div><?php endforeach; ?></div><button class="btn btn-primary">Simpan Tarif Berlaku</button></form></div></div><div class="box"><div class="box-body table-responsive"><table class="table"><tr><th>Area</th><th>Jenis Kendaraan</th><th>Berlaku</th><th>Orang</th><th>Kendaraan</th><th>Dermaga</th><th>Keputusan</th></tr><?php foreach($rows as $r): ?><tr><td><?= (int)$r['SpbbID'] ?></td><td><?= html_escape($r['VehicleType']) ?></td><td><?= html_escape($r['EffectiveDate']) ?></td><?php foreach(array('PersonRate','VehicleRate','BerthRate') as $key): ?><td>Rp <?= number_format($r[$key],0,',','.') ?></td><?php endforeach; ?><td><?= html_escape($r['DecisionNo']) ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></table></div></div></section></div>

<script>(function(){var form=document.getElementById('pass-tariff-form');document.querySelectorAll('[data-pass-preset]').forEach(function(button){button.addEventListener('click',function(){var large=button.dataset.passPreset==='large';form.elements.VehicleType.value=large?'TRUCK BESAR':'TRUCK SEDANG / GOL. V';form.elements.PersonRate.value='5000';form.elements.VehicleRate.value=large?'90000':'57600';form.elements.BerthRate.value=large?'29000':'25400';form.elements.DecisionNo.value='KD. 163/OP.404/ASDP-2020 Tanggal 29 April 2020';form.elements.EffectiveDate.focus();});});})();</script>
